  <EmailContent>
    <html>
      <head>
        <title>Verified Gross Mass Declaration</title>
      </head>
      <body>
        <p>Dear Shipping Line representative,</p>
        <p>Attached to this email please find an attachment containing the “Verified Gross Mass Declaration (VGM)”, as well as an additional attachment with the VGM as an EDI message (VERMAS message).</p>
        <p>
              Please note that we are very focused on turning this email process into a fully electronic process with your Shipping Line. As an option to support this, we are offering an introductory service at no cost for implementation and messaging for the exchange of:
              <ul><li>Electronic VGM (VERMAS)</li><li>Electronic Booking Requests</li><li>Electronic Shipping Instructions</li></ul></p>
        <p>
              We are also offering a range of services which allow you to publish valuable information back to your major Logistics customers such as:
              <ul><li>Status Events</li><li>Sailing Schedules</li><li>Rates management - including Standard Tariff and Customer Contract Rates</li><li>Certified, Rated Shipping Instructions</li><li>Spot Quote and Bid Request management</li></ul></p>
        <p>The community of WiseTech Global’s Freight Forwarding customers is very large (over 6000 corporations globally) and growing all the time. WiseTech Global is passionately committed to ensure that all our customers are electronically connected - simply, easily and at low cost to all major Shipping Lines for all forms of messaging.  Your Shipping Line and our mutual customers stand to gain significant productivity benefits from these integrations.</p>
        <p>In order to discuss the options for integration, please send a no-obligation email request to our Integration team at: carrierintegration@wisetechglobal.com</p>
        <p>Thank you.</p>
        <p>If there are any issues with the attachments to this email, please reply to support@wisetechglobal.com</p>
      </body>
    </html>
  </EmailContent>
